{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act18d3_level_act18d3_st01",
  "groupId": "act18d3",
  "stageId": "act18d3_st01",
  "title": "唤醒噩梦",
  "storyCode": "SV-ST-1",
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act18d3/level_act18d3_st01.txt",
  "sourceHash": "c4b166b68fbe3203572a82094f37cb19caa534dcccedaee1a815fab4b89036c0",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_184",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "快快，请进，请进。我知道你会来这里的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你怎么知道？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_184",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "该怎么解释呢......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呵。不用了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_184",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你到哪里都会背着那个箱子吗，吟游歌手？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_184",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那你介意我再问个问题吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "问。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_184",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这箱子里装的是什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "萨克斯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_184",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊，真不错，萨克斯......吹奏乐器吗。不错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_184",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我是否有幸听听它的音色？音乐......这座城市已经许多年没有音乐响起了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_184",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哦，不，抱歉......我忽然想到，吟游歌手要拿报酬。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_184",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这可难住我了，您看，恐怕我拿不出什么赏钱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_184",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "且看这座老建筑。哼，打理它是件相当困难的事，货币在这里代表不了什么，没人收集，也没人用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_184",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但我也有提供一顿午餐的余力。吟游歌手，怎么样？你愿不愿意随便演奏点什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_184",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "请你吃顿饱饭这种事我还算是能做到的，虽然也不是什么美味佳肴......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_184",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看你沉默不语的样子......啊，会不会是这样：比起音乐，你更喜欢舞蹈？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_184",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你看，你还穿着舞裙......有天赋的人。我们可太久没在这见到你这样光彩照人的朋友了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（......肉麻。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你如果要听什么，当时你就可以让我唱。不用到这。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我来是要问一个问题。你身边站着的这个人可能知道，现在我觉得你也脱不开干系。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_184",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我的，这位——熟人，过去和你认识吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "自然认识。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_184",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "没有问你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不认识。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_184",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哦......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "因为我不知道这个人是不是我当初认识的那个了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_184",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哦，哦......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_184",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这个，也是正常的。人都是会变的。海水拍打陆地，假以时日也能让海岸变成沙子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_184",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以你来这里，不是她让你来的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——不是你让我来的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_184",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "仅仅是我让你来，你是不会来这里的，对吧。我只是个陌生人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_184",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我只是问，她有没有让你来这里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "没有。我是自己来的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_184",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯，你没有说谎。我能听出谎言......但你是诚实的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "问这问那，我却什么都还没说，你怎么能这么讨人厌？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_184",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "消气，消气，歌手。我不是故意的。谨慎一点对我们都有好处。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那我来问。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这座城市里的人很信任你，但是，在海岸上发生的那些事——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "绝对不正常。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "乞食。恐鱼。海。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你是哪里人？你是不是知道些什么？你和她对我隐瞒了什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_184",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊，哈哈。是的，我知道的比别人确实要多一些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_184",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "确实，我知道有人想见你的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "见我？因为我是个吟游歌手？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_184",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在乎音乐的是我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_184",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "虽然这听上去有些荒唐，但想见你的其实不是我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_184",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "想见你的是我的一位朋友。应他要求，我才邀请你来到这里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "谁？他想见我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_184",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "随我来吧。见到他你就知道了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_184",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "毕竟......你也有一位朋友在这。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_184",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "请走这里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_184",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "至于你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_184",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你也来。赏赐你的时候也到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_184",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不好意思，我就不点灯了，不过这对你也没什么难度吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_184",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我听说吟游歌手大多数身手也不错，城市和荒野都不太友善，出远门的人很容易遭灾，一定得学一身保护自己的本事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_184",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "钱财买不到音乐，音乐却可以当货币，只要唱得一首好歌，到哪里都饿不死......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_184",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我以前也很向往这种生活，可能因为我并不擅长这些吧......一旦在哪扎下根，我就很难再离开了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_184",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们难道在......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_184",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "没错，在海底。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那是——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "幽灵鲨的身体漂浮在水缸之中，像是死了，又或者是睡熟了。\n多少想法在斯卡蒂脑中闪过。\n她为什么在这？是歌蕾蒂娅做的吗？如果幽灵鲨死了呢？歌蕾蒂娅怎么会允许幽灵鲨被杀？！难道她真的——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她就是你的朋友，对吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_184",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你是叫斯卡蒂吗？你的事不是我在跟。他们把你处理得很好......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_184",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "尤其是你身边的人。他们处理得很好，让你的精神状态保持在这种感觉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_184",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "最近他们没空管你，但拜你这位队长所赐，你到了这里，简直是送给我的礼物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_184",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "竟然是你先走上前......而不是那个歌手。你在等什么？之前你为什么没有杀我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你会有那么愚蠢吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_184",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你们这些孽物，从来都这个样子......自我感觉良好，又言之无物。这个试验品，她的生命在这里消失，也无所谓？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "确认过成果让你心安。你满意的神情溢于言表，却也不让我看你带她去了哪里。那么你还不能让她死。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们几个里，她的生命一定是你最看重的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我毁掉了你们那么多试验场地——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_184",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "果真是你做的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——幽灵鲨很宝贵。你对深海猎人实施源石感染性的测试，就只有这一个样本。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_184",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "陆生牲畜的原罪能在你们这些孽物身上起效，不是很有趣吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_184",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "虽然......我们三人的试验场真的被你毁掉太多了。投入了如此大量的、精炼过的液化源石，用上了阿戈尔的技术......都不能再复现。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_184",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她确实很宝贵。我只是想不通她是如何能对抗如此规模的源石感染......她的脊髓，经过稀释，也够感染一个小国。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_184",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "现在不一样了，谢谢你把她送到我手里，孽物。我会领先另外两人......我会发现你们最后的秘密。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_184",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我会证明自己的成就。我的研究。我们敌人的秘密。以及弱点......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你会先死在这。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我留你一命，证明了你是那个人。不值得留着的我已经处决掉了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "既然证明了你和他们，和这个实验的牵连，那你也不用活下去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "深海教会......你是深海教会的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_184",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我允许你这么称呼我了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "太能藏了。你们每个人都不一样。什么话都会说。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "幽灵鲨之所以会变得疯疯癫癫......也是因为你们的灌输和折磨吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "外面那些人，你利用了那些人。你也在把他们当试验品？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "投海的人......都成了你实验的牺牲品？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_184",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "放肆。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_184",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "大海的施舍可不是什么利用。这是救济。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_184",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我可以放着他们不管，他们会死。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_184",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "海洋给他们食物，给他们不愿活着的人自由活下去的新生......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_184",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你们这些孽物又怎么能理解......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可以了，主教。我表现出来关心你目的的态度了吗？如果你错会了，请你立刻忘记。你丑陋的行径涸墨难书，我只关心你的遗毒还能漂流多远。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "到这里就可以了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_184",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你以为你多带一个人......就可以稳胜我吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_184",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你和你的同类一样自信——一样愚蠢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你们有些人选择成为恐鱼这件事，我已经知道了。这恐怕不能成为底牌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "即使你能变成一只海嗣——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "二队长！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "凭歌蕾蒂娅的速度，她能在声音传来之前躲开。\n但是，前提是，歌蕾蒂娅想躲。\n歌蕾蒂娅并没有意识到......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗬，嗬嗬......（呛血的声音）......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_186",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Gla-dia。他的请求如此。我这么做了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_186",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "休息吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_186",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Ishar-mla。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_186",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Ishar-mla。我想见你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_186",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好多年的沉浮。好多年的游动。好多生死。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_184",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啐......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_184",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "愚蠢的孽物。如果不是使者需要你，你们这些孽物早就死在滩头。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "混蛋......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_184",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "使者，早点解决这个问题吧。看着这些侵害我们海洋的人，我总觉得恶心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_186",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你这么想攻击她们？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_184",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她们这些东西，阿戈尔创造出来的杂种，杀了我们多少同胞？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_186",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你是不是——不是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_186",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那我先问完这个问题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_186",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Ishar-mla，我的姐妹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "什么......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_184",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_186",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "姐妹，你现在也不清楚自己从哪里来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我来自阿戈尔，怪物......我是你的天敌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_186",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你不清楚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_186",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那就让我给你真相吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_186",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你们就是我们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_186",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你流着我们的血。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "扯谎！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_184",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "使者，你......什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_186",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Isha-mla。 你的血是我们的血。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_186",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你们肉体在那，然后我们的血进去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_186",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我有许多血亲。他们遇见你们。他们死去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_186",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他们闻见你们气味。就像你闻见我们气味。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_186",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他们以为同胞困在你们皮底。他们不顾危险撕咬你们皮肉，他们想从你们囊泡里把自己同胞释放。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_186",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他们还没有准备好，他们那时还没有器官去了解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_186",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你们没有在体内困住同胞。你们就是我们同胞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_186",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Ishar-mla。你就是我们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_186",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我会唤醒你。你会想起那种感觉。阿戈尔人的身体脆弱，事物过去太快。我会帮你找到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "停下。停下！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_186",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但你，想知道。我知道你想知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你们杀害我们阿戈尔人......现在又想来和我沾亲带故？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_186",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我的血与你的血相同。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_186",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你闻到我们气味，正如我们闻见你气味。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_186",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你们找到我们，杀死我们......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_186",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们不懂时，我们也杀死你们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_186",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们喂养海洋。我们的尸体供养了海洋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_186",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Ishar-mla，我们拥有同个故乡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你们杀了我的家人。是你们杀了我的妈妈，我的奶奶，我的妹妹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_186",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，不会。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_186",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们不去阿戈尔城市。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那么多的城市都被你们毁了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_186",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那些城市在我们领地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呵，即使在阿戈尔腹地的城市，也会有人被你们捕猎！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_186",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不......不。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_186",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们不这么做。在城市死去无法供养族群。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_186",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "阿戈尔人攻击我们，我们攻击阿戈尔人。没有区别。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_186",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你们领地里的人的死，是你领地里的人做的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "说谎！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_186",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "说谎？我想知道说谎的意思。“扯谎”，刚才你也说了。我想知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，不......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_186",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Ishar-mla，你和我们间的阻隔太强。你没有办法把想法传给我们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_186",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你能知道我们所想，这也够了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_186",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我的身体生长，能够说语言，能和你交流。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_186",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "语言臃肿，不好使用，我只能这样说，但是这样你就能告诉我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_186",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Ishar-mla，我为见你而来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我和你......不......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_186",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你时常感觉，周围活物，与你陌生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_186",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你在游动时，能够感到海水方向，也能知道没有光的海里的各种事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_186",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你有些时候睡下，感到自己与大群同游。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......你为什么要说。为什么要说？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_186",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你回忆起来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_184",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......不可能......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_184",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "为什么......之前没有......为什么我们没能看出来？！我们为什么查不出？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_186",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Ishar-mla。 我有问题要问，Ishar-mla。抬起头来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我杀了它。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_186",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你没有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我杀了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我杀了祂......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "祂什么都没做，而我......我却......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就连我的......我的妹妹......也是......阿戈尔人......阿戈尔人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_186",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "罪？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我的罪恶......我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_186",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Ishar-mla，不要疑惑。我们没有罪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_186",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你只是做了你会做的事，Ishar-mla，同胞做的没罪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可我替阿戈尔......我们杀了那么多......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_186",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你认为自己是阿戈尔，那么你杀也对。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_186",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你把其他人当做血亲，所以你那么做，我们不知道，我们攻击你们时候你那么做，也对。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "为什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_186",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——Ishar-mla。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_186",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "阿戈尔，无鳞，你们语言里才有“罪”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_186",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "为生存做，都是对。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_186",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你没有错。所以你知道的都可说，我们没有愿意，只有说和不说。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_186",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我会问问题。说吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_186",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Ishar-mla。在你们的攻击下，我们失去了同它之间的联系，密切的联系。我们只能感受到它的搏动，没法听到它声音。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_186",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你们最后一次同游，最后一次一起攻击，就是那时。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_186",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_186",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "当它在你面前又一次沉眠时，你有没有——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_186",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "听到它说话？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "祂——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "祂说——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_184",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你？！使者！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_186",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊。只能下次......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_186",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（体液堵塞的声音）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_186",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Gla-dia......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_186",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（呜咽一样的声音）......你很健壮，Gla-dia。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "垃圾。（阿戈尔语）对你我不会有一丝礼貌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（阿戈尔语）猎物就该乖乖......困在陷阱里惨叫。你才是猎物，垃圾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_186",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "姐妹......你信号的传递......密集。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "情绪。恨。猎物怎么会懂？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "爱。恨。痛苦。悲伤。欢乐。欣慰。在你们看来都无用。你们觉得这是渣碎......是不必要的东西，是赘余，是不是?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_186",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们没有你说的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那么你就更不会懂，垃圾。我们宁可身有赘余也要那样活下去。我们不是你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_186",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Gla-dia。情绪。真是很强的情绪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你连歌都不会唱。死吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_184",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "为什么——怎么会？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_184",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "为什么她的身体能从那种伤害中恢复？？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
